      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The issue apparently stems from a system to make object sync sleep when not needed. But it triggers too easily and doesn't seem to wake up once entering sleep.\n\nMy suspicion is that switching to the legacy VRC_SyncAnimation component has effectively exempted it from this sleep system, avoiding these issues for the Elevator. That being said, I did want to test it again before reporting it to ensure results were consistent.",
