  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I havn't done much testing so I don't have too much information on it, but, in elevator VR, after we finished a run, objects were all syncing fine. Eventually, object sync broke on everything. \n\nBefore this, strong bad had to replace object sync with animation sync because object sync was also breaking on that\n\nSomeone we met later that night reported object sync also breaking for them in a different world, after a certain amount of time. \n\nEven with little info to help, I just wanted to make sure that it's known that object sync seems to have some kind of issue that only starts to happen after a certain time",
